  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "A selection of Hell Camp short stories produced by legendary writers Lee Hyeon-Se and Lee Du-Ho! Discover the powerful debuts of 24 of the strongest rookies of 2025!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Stories Included:*\n1. **Drop the Outsider** (드랍 더 아웃사이더) \\[Ju-Won Lee\\]\n2. **Statue Racing** (스타츄르레이싱) \\[Cheongwi\\]\n3. **Kkumui Haebu** (꿈의 해부) \\[Nenem\\]\n4. **Lucky Planet** (럭키플래닛) \\[Garak\\]\n5. **Jakjeonmyeong Uri Hyeong** (작전명 우리 형) \\[Yasaengma\\]\n6. **Dead reckoning** (Dead reckoning) \\[Mu-Am Hyeon\\]\n7. **Naeirui Neoege** (내일의 너에게) \\[Wanpa\\]\n8, **Mayday** (메이데이) \\[Min-Hui\\]\n9. **Out of Focus** (아웃포커스) \\[Yeoni\\]\n10. **Ttongpari♥Ganjjajang** (똥파리♥간짜장) \\[Sae-Ha Min\\]\n11. **Eumseong Saseohameuro Yeongyeoldoemnida** (음성사서함으로 연결됩니다) \\[Si-Nae Seo\\]\n12, **Gyeranmariui Modeun Geot** (계란말이의 모든 것) \\[Gu-Jong Ji\\]\n13. **DUMMY BUNNY** (DUMMY BUNNY) \\[Yi-Seo\\]\n14. **Yong-nim, Bireul Naeryeojuseyo!** (용님, 비를 내려주세요!) \\[Ragoha\\]\n15. **Miraereul Boneun Sajingwan** (미래를 보는 사진관) \\[Moen\\]\n16. **Typhoon Gjuuibo!** (태풍주의보!) \\[Nice\\]\n17. **Ineo Pamnida** (인어 팝니다) \\[Bongsung-appyeo\\]\n18. **Uri Jiben Cheonsaga Sanda** (우리 집엔 천사가 산다) \\[Ji-Won\\]\n19. **Nae Eommarago!** (내 엄마라고!) \\[Kyeong\\]\n20. **Bunsin** (분신) \\[Moheu\\]\n21. **Yeon-U-ege, Seonsaengnimi** (연우에게, 선생님이) \\[Ttaenggeul\\]\n22. **Uju Choehuui Nal** (우주 최후의 날) \\[Rak Lee\\]\n23. **Working Piggy Holliday** (워킹 피기 홀리데이) \\[Cheonjin\\]\n24. **Jibung Ttulko Jigu myeolmang!** (지붕 뚫고 지구 멸망!) \\[Sunsu\\]",
